  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28513001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "您又来了……今天过得顺利吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28513003",
              "text": "谢谢，柔嘉呢？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28513003",
              "text": "柔嘉比以前开朗了许多呢~"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28513002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28513003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "我……阿，您来是为了什么事吧……\n有什么……可以帮忙吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28513005",
              "text": "只是想来看看柔嘉。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28513005",
              "text": "先说说柔嘉的事吧？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28513004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28513005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "……谢谢您。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28513006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "柔嘉总是把别人放在第一位，丝毫不在意自己的感受呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28513007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可以说说看吗，柔嘉刚才想说的，关于自己的事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28513008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "任性表达自己的心意……真的可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28513010",
              "text": "这才不是任性。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28513010",
              "text": "这是柔嘉应有的权利。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28513009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28513010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "谢谢……柔嘉觉得很开心……\n只要能更多地陪在您的身边，一切后果，我都愿意承受。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28513011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是什么话，陪伴是相互的事情，才没有后果这种说法。\n在这里，柔嘉想待多久就待多久。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28513012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "谢谢您……\n我也想像您一样……学会用温柔的力量去对待别人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
